      "content": "Box breathing works by intentionally regulating your breath to trigger your body's relaxation response. By equalizing the inhale, hold, exhale, and hold times, you signal to your nervous system that you are safe. This controlled pattern shifts your body from the \"fight or flight\" sympathetic mode to the parasympathetic \"rest and digest\" mode, calming anxiety.",
